# Allow-list: exclude everything, then re-include only what the image build
# needs (the nextsql / nextsqld / nextsql-entrypoint binaries compile from Go
# source). Keeps the build context small and keeps secrets / local state out
# of every layer and the build cache.
*

# Go module graph + the sources the binaries compile from.
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!drivers/

# Re-exclude noise inside the re-included trees.
**/node_modules/
**/*_test.go
internal/admin/frontend/
